{"id":"70fa8a4e-7724-4160-97fd-1c2f75c33fd6","title":"Data Cube 1","slug":"data-cube-1","collectionSlug":"data-cube","collectionName":"Data Cube","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A dark, atmospheric shader effect featuring ASCII characters arranged in a 3D perspective grid pattern. The background is a very dark navy-black color (#0d0d29). Overlaid on this are ASCII numerals (3, 2, 7, 4, 0, 6, 5, 1) rendered in a monospace font (JetBrains Mono) with a cell size of 30 pixels. The characters create a tunnel or corridor effect, converging toward the center of the image with strong perspective distortion. A vibrant thin-film iridescent effect is applied to the ASCII layer, creating a dynamic color shift across the characters. The dominant colors in the effect are bright electric blue (#2b6fff) transitioning through magenta/purple (#820fff and #990af7), creating a neon-like glow. The effect has a rim width of 3 pixels with high intensity (1.77), producing a luminous, glowing appearance around each character. The characters appear to have a hexagonal shape influence from the underlying thin-film shader, with a dispersion value of 0.7 creating chromatic aberration-like color separation. The overall mood is cyberpunk and digital, with a sense of depth and movement. The spacing between characters is uniform at 1.0, and the entire composition uses ACES tone mapping for enhanced color grading. The effect creates an illusion of looking down a digital tunnel or matrix-like corridor with iridescent, color-shifting text.","colors":["#0d0d29","#2b6fff","#820fff","#990af7"],"labels":["geometric","glowing","3d","dark"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/70fa8a4e-7724-4160-97fd-1c2f75c33fd6.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"SolidColor","id":"idmss378gxx5f2k6ejq","_key":"key_mss378gxx5f2k6ejq","props":{"color":"#0d0d29","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode":"normal","transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"